The sitemap is generated at build time from vite.config.ts when VITE_SITE_URL is set
(see the siteMeta plugin). With no custom domain configured, no sitemap is emitted.

To connect a custom domain:
  1. Set VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com in frontend/.env
  2. Rebuild: npm run build
  3. Point your DNS at your host and serve the dist/ folder (or run the backend
     in production mode and serve dist/ behind the same origin).
